<https://caselinker.up.railway.app/resource/case/wy_dci_2025_002/admission/1> a cacontology-undercover:IncriminatingStatement ;
    rdfs:label "appreciated meeting law enforcement from all over the world, including from war-worn countries like Ukraine and Pales..." ;
    dcterms:source <https://cowboystatedaily.com/2025/01/26/how-a-budding-gillette-baseball-star-and-marine-became-a-pedophile-hunter/> ;
    ns1:admissionContext ") at the University of Wyoming. Along with the physical and mental aspect of the program, McDonald said he appreciated meeting law enforc..." ;
    ns1:admissionFrame "said_paraphrase" ;
    ns1:admissionTheme "other" ;
    ns1:attributedToOffenderRole <https://caselinker.up.railway.app/resource/case/wy_dci_2025_002/role/offender/1> ;
    ns1:evidenceTier "press_release_stated" ;
    ns1:quoteType "paraphrase" ;
    uco-core:description "appreciated meeting law enforcement from all over the world, including from war-worn countries like Ukraine and Palestine, where the mass scale of terrorism is an everyday reality" .

<https://caselinker.up.railway.app/resource/case/wy_dci_2025_002/admission/2> a cacontology-undercover:IncriminatingStatement ;
    rdfs:label "felt compelled to “put on the greens” only to be told he was too old to re-enlist" ;
    dcterms:source <https://cowboystatedaily.com/2025/01/26/how-a-budding-gillette-baseball-star-and-marine-became-a-pedophile-hunter/> ;
    ns1:admissionContext "the way to go. Then 9/11 happened, and once again McDonald’s priorities were rearranged. He said he felt compelled to “put on the greens”..." ;
    ns1:admissionFrame "he_said_paraphrase" ;
    ns1:admissionTheme "other" ;
    ns1:attributedToOffenderRole <https://caselinker.up.railway.app/resource/case/wy_dci_2025_002/role/offender/1> ;
    ns1:evidenceTier "press_release_stated" ;
    ns1:quoteType "paraphrase" ;
    uco-core:description "felt compelled to “put on the greens” only to be told he was too old to re-enlist" .

